96","id":5943102629,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYjyMpQ","user":{"login":"Lemonymous","id":10490534,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNDkwNTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10490534?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lemonymous","html_url":"https://github.com/Lemonymous","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lemonymous/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lemonymous/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lemonymous/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lemonymous/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lemonymous/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lemonymous/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lemonymous/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lemonymous/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lemonymous/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-02T00:11:04Z","updated_at":"2026-10-02T00:11:04Z","body":"> I haven't run the code, but it looks like this might be the issue\n> \n> ```\n> uniform_set_write = rd.uniform_set_create([uniP], shader_write, 0)\n> ```\n\nYou seem to be right.\nChanging uniP to uniW - which was intended for that line - fixes all of the examples in the OP.\n\nWhat this MRP instead demonstrates (due to the bug in my code), is how passing the same buffer as a uniform and using it for the indirect dispatch, causes you to see old information from that buffer for the rest of the compute list. Which I suppose might be intended.\n\nI made this MRP to try to replicate an issue in my project, but I guess I was unsuccessful at that.\n\nI'll close this Issue as it does not show what it says it shows.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5943102629/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]